title Four kinds of silence
prompt Keaton -- kg
think Went for glow, 67 unreached, and found a choir already existed for that family -- one that LISTS its 28 members. 97 glow witnesses stand in tools/g today, so 69 have accumulated outside a list written on 20260828. That is the stale-list fault the discovering choirs were built to avoid, seen in the wild.
think Ran the family whole before writing anything: 93 green, 4 red. It took two background passes and most of an hour, which is itself a reading -- this family is slow where the font family was 1.7s a member.
obs THE FOUR REDS WERE NOT ONE THING, and neither were the choir reds beside them. A sample of 10 unreached CHOIRS ran 6 green and 4 red -- a 40 percent red rate against 12.5 for individual witnesses, which follows from a choir reding when any member does.
obs Reading all of them gives FOUR KINDS, and only the first is a defect. A genuine finding. An absent optional dependency -- an uninitialised gratitude/tigerbeetle submodule, an unbuilt wayland_seed, a missing qemu-riscv64. And a fourth I had not met: a witness that HANGS without its environment rather than failing, which two glow desk witnesses did past 250 seconds.
obs Each of the last three makes a witness UNROSTABLE, which is very likely why it is unreached. So `unreached` counts neglect and environment together, and the environment half is repaired by teaching a witness to SKIP rather than by writing a roster row.
obs Repaired the two cross-target witnesses that way and proved it both directions: absent, they skip and read green; with a stub emulator on PATH the skip stops and the first emulated leg fails as it should. A skip that cannot stop skipping is not a skip.
obs Declined to roster glow. Two members hang rather than fail, and a row for them would hang the fleet -- a worse outcome than the silence it would end.
obs The lever for later is counted: 80 of the 750 unreached are themselves choirs, and rostering one carries its whole family.
loom glow_family members=97 green=93 red=4 choir_lists=28 accumulated_outside_list=69
